<Base title="Let's talk" description="Talk with Ahmed Avais about AI in engineering teams, lasting change, leadership coaching, workshops and talks." ask={false}>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Let's talk</h1>
    <p>If you lead engineering teams and something here sounds familiar, I'd like to hear about it. Most of my work has started with a conversation, so that's the place to begin.</p>

    <h2>What we could talk about</h2>
    <h3>Your teams and AI</h3>
    <p>I can help you bring AI into your engineering work without losing quality or people, from specs, harnesses and review safety nets to the human side of the change.</p>
    <h3>Change that sticks</h3>
    <p>I help organizations shift the patterns that hold old habits in place, so new ways of working last, whether you have one team or two hundred.</p>
    <h3>1:1 leadership development</h3>
    <p>As an ICF Professional Certified Coach, I work one-on-one with engineering leaders on the challenges in front of them and the leaders they want to become.</p>
    <h3>Workshops and talks</h3>
    <p>I run hands-on sessions for teams and leaders, including agile games that let people practice new ways of working before they try them for real.</p>

    <h2>Talks and sessions</h2>
    <ul class="talks">
      {talksAndSessions.map((talk) => (
        <li><cite>{talk.title}</cite> <span class="talk-where">{talk.venue}, {talk.year}</span></li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>Email me at <a href="mailto:ahmed@agile-7.com">ahmed@agile-7.com</a> and tell me a little about your teams and what's on your mind, or find me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ahmedavais">LinkedIn</a> if you'd rather start there.</p>
  </article>
